cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "hw-verify-mcp: hardware security checkers as MCP tools for AI agents"
message: "If you use this in academic work, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - alias: nickharris808
    website: "https://github.com/nickharris808"
repository-code: "https://github.com/nickharris808/hw-verify-mcp"
url: "https://huggingface.co/spaces/nickh007/hw-verify"
abstract: >-
  Exposes constant-time, masking, and patch-completeness checkers over the Model Context Protocol, so an agent writing hardware gets a checker it cannot argue with. Every refusal carries a next step, the agent cannot set the verdict itself, and a design the analysis cannot read returns a null rather than a false clean result.
keywords:
  - mcp
  - ai agents
  - hardware security
  - constant-time
  - formal verification
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-07-28"
